  "bodyHash": "5b0762c1ef2bc13f",
  "content": "\n\n<h6 style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Enchantments/logo.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"160\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 此模組為遊戲增添了全新的獨特附魔。<br>我致力於加入符合 Minecraft 風格的附魔，並確保它們盡可能保持<br>平衡。所有附魔的詳細說明可參見 <a href=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MajruszsEnchantmentsMod/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>。<br><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">自 1.0.0 版本起，本模組需要安裝 <a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/majrusz-library\" rel=\"nofollow\">Majrusz Library</a> 才能運作！</span></strong><br></span> <br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Enchantments/changes.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"85\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> - <strong>19+</strong> 種全新附魔與 <strong>5+</strong> 種全新詛咒<br>- 所有附魔均可在設定檔中高度自訂<br>- 盾牌與馬甲現在可進行附魔<br>- 支援 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/enchantment-descriptions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Enchantment Descriptions</a><br>- 支援 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei-enchantment-info\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI Enchantment Info</a><br></span> <br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Enchantments/stuff.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"85\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>炸彈切割者</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 當玩家舉盾格擋時，取消周圍的爆炸效果。<br></span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Enchantments/fuse_cutter.gif?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>念動力</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 挖掘方塊與擊殺生物時，若背包有空位會直接將物品收入其中。<br></span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Enchantments/telekinesis.gif?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>第六感</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 偵測生物的腳步聲，並在數秒內將其標記顯示。<br></span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Enchantments/sixth_sense.gif?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>冰霜騎手</strong><br></span> <span style=\"font-size:14px\"> 馬匹踏過水面時，會生成結霜冰塊。<br></span> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Enchantments/frost_rider.gif?raw=true\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"> <strong>還有更多內容！</strong><br></span> <br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Enchantments/languages.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"185\"> <br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Enchantments/thanks.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"85\"> <br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> - <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/chechnyacool488\" rel=\"nofollow\">chechnyacool488</a>, <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/nikita28466\" rel=\"nofollow\">nikita28466</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/lottuce-yami\" rel=\"nofollow\">lottuce-yami</a> 提供俄文翻譯<br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/kw2341\" rel=\"nofollow\">0골덕0</a> 提供韓文翻譯<br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/giovyxz_00\" rel=\"nofollow\">giovyxz_00</a> 提供義大利文翻譯<br>- <a href=\"https://github.com/Pancakes0228\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pancakes0228</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/Andows96\" rel=\"nofollow\">Andows96</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/Fiocher\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fiocher</a> 提供中文翻譯<br>- <a href=\"https://github.com/crafting-Aaron\" rel=\"nofollow\">crafting-Aaron</a>, <a href=\"https://github.com/critvanilla\" rel=\"nofollow\">critvanilla</a> 提供西班牙文翻譯<br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/member/coliop/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Coliop</a> 提供法文翻譯<br>- <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/omerkayra01210\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kaira#8571</a> 提供土耳其文翻譯<br>- <a href=\"https://github.com/unroman\" rel=\"nofollow\">unroman</a> 提供烏克蘭文翻譯<br></span> <br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9UF774WcuW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Library/discord.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"138\"> </a> <br><a href=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MajruszsEnchantmentsMod/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://github.com/Majrusz/MinecraftCommon/blob/main/Library/mod_wiki.png?raw=true\" width=\"800\" height=\"138\"> </a></h6>",
